WEBVTT

00:10.010 --> 00:12.137
Stay still, you bastard!

00:12.220 --> 00:14.639
You are under arrest for murder.

00:14.723 --> 00:16.558
You have the right to an attorney.

00:17.058 --> 00:19.894
- You have the right to remain silent.
- Let me go, you bastards!

00:20.395 --> 00:23.940
- Anything you say can and will be…
- Let go of me!

00:32.115 --> 00:34.117
Please save

00:35.368 --> 00:38.038
my mom, dad, and brother.

00:45.045 --> 00:46.296
Hey, get a move on.

00:51.468 --> 00:54.721
Are we all set? Detective Jo,
what about the victim's statement?

00:55.346 --> 00:56.681
Yes, it's all ready.

00:57.348 --> 00:59.350
Why are you still wearing bloody clothes?

00:59.434 --> 01:02.604
Hey, reporters are swarming outside.
Don't let your guard down.

01:03.104 --> 01:04.147
Yes, sir.

01:08.860 --> 01:09.861
Hey.

01:10.737 --> 01:13.531
I'll take you to the hospital soon.

01:14.032 --> 01:15.909
Sit here for a bit, okay?

01:16.618 --> 01:17.452
All right.

01:38.014 --> 01:39.307
Detective Jo!

01:39.808 --> 01:41.851
Look at the kid! He's got a gun!

01:43.812 --> 01:45.438
No, Lee Do! Don't do it!

01:46.106 --> 01:47.190
Don't do anything.

01:48.399 --> 01:49.317
Lee Do.

01:49.400 --> 01:50.235
- Hey.
- Lee Do!

01:51.069 --> 01:52.403
Look at me, okay?

01:52.904 --> 01:53.738
Shoot me.

01:53.822 --> 01:55.073
Shut up, you bastard!

01:57.117 --> 01:58.243
What's stopping you?

01:58.326 --> 01:59.369
Lee Do!

02:00.411 --> 02:01.538
Shoot me.

02:10.672 --> 02:12.257
Shooting at Yeongseong Gosiwon.

02:12.340 --> 02:15.176
All nearby units, deploy immediately!

02:15.260 --> 02:17.804
I repeat. Shooting at Yeongseong Gosiwon.

02:17.887 --> 02:19.222
All nearby units…

02:34.028 --> 02:35.530
- Are you okay?
- Help me.

02:47.625 --> 02:48.877
Officer Kim! Hold on.

02:51.838 --> 02:53.464
- Where's the shooter?
- Inside.

02:53.548 --> 02:54.549
Let's go.

03:01.598 --> 03:02.432
Go in.

03:09.939 --> 03:10.773
At least…

03:14.194 --> 03:16.404
the end of my life turned out okay.

03:17.530 --> 03:18.364
You there!

03:19.240 --> 03:20.533
Drop the gun. Put your hands up.

03:25.038 --> 03:25.955
Hello there.

03:27.081 --> 03:28.082
Don't move!

03:29.250 --> 03:30.835
You see, guns are

03:32.045 --> 03:34.297
actually surprisingly easy to use.

03:35.882 --> 03:36.799
So convenient.

03:36.883 --> 03:38.635
Drop the gun and put your hands up!

03:39.177 --> 03:40.803
I heard a police officer's gun…

03:42.805 --> 03:44.807
always fires a blank as the first round.

03:44.891 --> 03:46.309
What?

04:00.990 --> 04:01.991
Get out!

04:02.533 --> 04:03.534
Get out! Now!

04:06.913 --> 04:07.997
Don't save anyone.

04:08.081 --> 04:09.499
These bastards are all trash.

04:10.500 --> 04:13.670
An officer has been shot.
All units entering must be armed.

04:13.753 --> 04:16.172
The suspect is currently armed
with a machine gun.

04:17.799 --> 04:19.092
- Hey!
- Are you okay?

04:19.175 --> 04:20.635
- Yes.
- And the people inside?

04:20.718 --> 04:22.887
They're too scared to come out.

04:25.098 --> 04:26.557
Come out, you bastards!

04:28.059 --> 04:29.143
- Wait here.
- What?

04:29.227 --> 04:31.479
- Think you can hide from me?
- Officer Lee!

04:40.071 --> 04:42.907
You shouldn't have ignored me, should you?

04:44.826 --> 04:47.912
This wouldn't have happened
if we all followed the rules.

04:49.872 --> 04:52.208
You're the ones who drove me to this.

04:52.875 --> 04:55.461
Did I ask for too much? Huh?

05:00.216 --> 05:02.135
Just not to touch people's food

05:02.927 --> 05:05.054
and to keep your voices down
in shared areas.

05:06.472 --> 05:08.016
Is that so hard?

05:12.312 --> 05:13.938
Don't get your hopes up.

05:14.856 --> 05:16.482
There's no such thing here.

05:20.028 --> 05:23.156
Your life is stuck in the gutter,
just like mine.

05:24.574 --> 05:26.117
I'll spare you the trouble

05:27.160 --> 05:28.494
by killing you all.

05:36.127 --> 05:38.629
Just wait.
I'll find every last one of you.

05:50.016 --> 05:50.850
Found you!

05:52.977 --> 05:54.103
Please don't kill me!

05:57.023 --> 05:58.608
Listen to me carefully.

05:59.108 --> 06:00.443
The shooter has an M4.

06:00.526 --> 06:03.029
He fired three shots after reloading,
leaving 27.

06:06.532 --> 06:07.658
Make that 24.

06:07.742 --> 06:09.827
I'll distract him
and make him waste his ammo.

06:09.911 --> 06:11.329
You save the people inside.

06:11.412 --> 06:13.206
Officer Lee, what are you going to do?

06:13.289 --> 06:16.459
Don't worry about me.
We must save as many as we can, okay?

06:23.966 --> 06:24.967
What the hell?

07:33.327 --> 07:34.328
Damn it.

07:37.457 --> 07:38.458
Goddamn it!

07:47.133 --> 07:48.384
Come out.

07:48.468 --> 07:49.469
This way.

08:03.191 --> 08:06.527
You motherfuckers!
I told you not to save anyone!

08:15.578 --> 08:16.996
Get in there! Hurry!

08:22.084 --> 08:23.085
Why did you…

08:44.690 --> 08:45.525
Thank you.

08:47.360 --> 08:49.529
- Traffic control needed.
- No photos!

08:49.612 --> 08:51.697
- Support units, move now.
- Copy that.

08:54.492 --> 08:55.910
Chief Yoon! Over here!

08:55.993 --> 08:56.869
Chief Yoon!

08:56.953 --> 08:58.329
Chief Yoon! A quick word?

09:06.087 --> 09:07.004
Anything on camera?

09:07.088 --> 09:10.967
The computer storing the files
was destroyed, so they can't be retrieved.

09:11.592 --> 09:12.802
And the witnesses?

09:12.885 --> 09:15.263
They're in no state to testify yet.
It'll take time.

09:15.346 --> 09:17.265
For God's sake.

09:19.183 --> 09:21.727
- Can you check these labels?
- Yes, one moment.

09:28.651 --> 09:30.486
Can you also check unit 308?

09:48.713 --> 09:49.839
Finish up here.

09:51.465 --> 09:52.466
Yes, sir.

10:07.231 --> 10:11.152
I remember preparing for the police exam
in a gosiwon not long ago.

10:12.111 --> 10:13.529
I was in a room just like this

10:14.238 --> 10:16.574
and was on the verge of losing my mind.

10:22.204 --> 10:25.333
Are gosiwon beds made
of nailed plywood these days?

10:25.416 --> 10:28.419
No, that can't be.
It's a bed, not a coffin.

10:34.425 --> 10:35.259
Officer Lee!

10:38.763 --> 10:39.764
Officer Jang.

10:41.057 --> 10:42.725
Have you ever seen this before?

10:43.559 --> 10:45.770
Chief! We found more guns in here.

10:45.853 --> 10:46.812
What?

10:48.856 --> 10:51.776
They've already been scanned,
so you can check them yourself.

10:52.818 --> 10:54.403
These are all automatic rifles.

10:55.780 --> 10:58.157
Call the military now
and have them send an expert.

10:58.240 --> 10:59.241
Yes, sir.

11:00.660 --> 11:02.370
Hey, call them now and…

11:11.587 --> 11:12.421
Hey!

11:12.505 --> 11:14.256
I told you to bring in an expert.

11:14.340 --> 11:19.303
Well, Officer Lee spent a long time
in the military before joining the police.

11:19.387 --> 11:23.349
Then tell us what you know about these
until the expert arrives.

11:26.018 --> 11:27.812
What's he doing over there?

11:28.854 --> 11:30.940
If you're not sure, just stay out of it.

11:31.023 --> 11:32.024
No, sir.

11:34.068 --> 11:35.277
Allow me to explain.

12:37.131 --> 12:38.424
I'll give you a rundown.

12:40.134 --> 12:44.513
This is the XM177E2, a rifle widely used
by US Special Forces SOG in Vietnam.

12:44.597 --> 12:47.057
This is the AK-47,
a 7.62 mm Kalashnikov rifle,

12:47.141 --> 12:50.519
mainly made in the former Soviet Union.

12:50.603 --> 12:51.812
And this is the MP5,

12:52.396 --> 12:55.941
a German submachine gun
introduced in 1964,

12:56.025 --> 12:58.694
an iconic weapon
of counterterrorism forces globally.

12:58.778 --> 13:01.614
Lastly, this is the MK18 MOD1,

13:02.114 --> 13:05.534
the standard-issue rifle
of US Special Operations,

13:05.618 --> 13:09.121
a modernized M4 widely used
by US Special Forces.

13:09.205 --> 13:14.168
So you're saying guns from past wars
and overseas conflicts

13:14.668 --> 13:16.754
have surfaced in Korea?

13:17.254 --> 13:19.840
And in a gosiwon, of all places?

13:20.883 --> 13:21.717
Yes, sir.

13:22.676 --> 13:23.803
There's a bigger issue.

13:23.886 --> 13:27.306
Do you recall
the dozens of bullets found before?

13:27.389 --> 13:30.434
You mean the ones found
in the rooftop room?

13:30.518 --> 13:31.769
Yes.

13:31.852 --> 13:33.479
It's under investigation. Why?

13:36.982 --> 13:38.400
The bullets found there

13:39.652 --> 13:41.153
and the guns on this table…

13:43.155 --> 13:44.490
are all fully compatible.

13:51.455 --> 13:52.581
In my opinion,

13:53.958 --> 13:56.377
these two cases appear to be connected.

13:57.920 --> 13:58.921
Everyone.

13:59.880 --> 14:01.799
Looks like we've found something big.

14:02.883 --> 14:05.678
Make sure everyone keeps quiet,
especially the reporters.

14:05.761 --> 14:06.887
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

14:07.429 --> 14:08.806
Clean up everything here too.

14:20.025 --> 14:21.026
Man, I'm starving.

14:21.110 --> 14:23.112
For fuck's sake, when's he coming out?

14:23.612 --> 14:24.446
Is it good?

14:24.947 --> 14:26.699
A brutal mass shooting at a gosiwon…

14:26.782 --> 14:28.701
Holy shit. Take a look at this, Jeong-man.

14:28.784 --> 14:30.327
…has shocked the public.

14:30.411 --> 14:34.498
The police apprehended the suspect, Yu,
a resident of the gosiwon…

14:34.582 --> 14:36.542
Are we in the States or what?

14:36.625 --> 14:39.253
Fucking hell, what's going on in Korea?
I don't like this.

14:39.336 --> 14:41.046
- What is it?
- Stop being so dramatic.

14:41.547 --> 14:42.882
Shit.

14:42.965 --> 14:45.426
- He was shooting people and shit.
- Shit. That's fucked.

14:51.432 --> 14:54.351
- Hey, go in and see what's happening.
- Yes, sir.

15:00.858 --> 15:02.484
Walk straight, you bastard!

15:03.485 --> 15:06.572
Let go, you motherfuckers!
Let me go, you bastards!

15:06.655 --> 15:07.531
Stay still!

15:07.615 --> 15:09.283
Yong-gu, you son of a bitch!

15:10.242 --> 15:12.244
Yong-gu, that fucking bastard.

15:12.328 --> 15:13.495
Hey, Gong!

15:13.996 --> 15:15.539
Seok-ho, you motherfucker!

15:16.040 --> 15:17.750
Seok-ho, you fucking asshole!

15:18.918 --> 15:21.337
Spare me, you son of a bitch! Please!

15:21.420 --> 15:22.755
Let's talk this out.

15:22.838 --> 15:24.965
Let's go in, grab a fucking drink, and--

15:25.049 --> 15:26.091
That's too bad.

15:26.175 --> 15:29.261
I quit drinking as of today.
I want to live a long life.

15:29.345 --> 15:31.305
- Seok-ho.
- I asked nicely before.

15:31.388 --> 15:33.682
If you'd given up the business,
we wouldn't be here.

15:33.766 --> 15:36.101
Let's talk this out! Yeah?

15:37.645 --> 15:39.104
You fucking bastard!

15:39.188 --> 15:41.607
Let go of me, you fuckers!

15:42.107 --> 15:42.942
Fuck.

15:47.696 --> 15:50.491
Good work, everyone.

15:50.991 --> 15:52.618
- Go get some rest.
- Yes, sir.

15:53.577 --> 15:55.037
- Yong-gu.
- Yes, sir.

15:55.120 --> 15:57.706
Once I sort out the shares,
I'll hand the business over.

15:57.790 --> 15:58.916
Yes, sir.

16:00.542 --> 16:03.295
- I'm off. Take good care of him.
- Yes, sir.

16:03.379 --> 16:05.339
You fucking asshole!
Fucking son of a bitch!

16:05.422 --> 16:07.841
Gong, you fucking traitor!

16:07.925 --> 16:11.428
You motherfucker!
Let me go, you little shitheads!

16:14.473 --> 16:15.683
You motherfuckers!

16:19.687 --> 16:21.063
Gloves on. Let's get ready.

16:22.356 --> 16:23.190
Jeong-man!

16:29.321 --> 16:31.198
- Okay, let's go.
- Let's go.

16:33.993 --> 16:35.119
Let's go.

16:35.202 --> 16:36.662
- Hello.
- Hello.

16:37.287 --> 16:38.831
On three. One, two, three.

16:40.666 --> 16:43.002
- This is gonna be a pain.
- Hey, busters.

16:44.503 --> 16:46.130
Make sure to clean thoroughly.

16:46.213 --> 16:48.674
It's pretty messy today, huh?

16:49.675 --> 16:51.927
For fuck's sake. Then come out earlier.

16:52.011 --> 16:55.014
You take your fucking time
and then tell us to hurry the fuck up.

16:55.097 --> 16:56.056
Don't be so dramatic.

16:56.890 --> 16:58.559
Fucking stupid busters.

16:58.642 --> 17:00.728
Don't look at me like that, motherfucker.

17:10.404 --> 17:12.656
Have you lost your mind?
Who ordered that for him?

17:14.450 --> 17:16.493
Are we at a Chinese restaurant
or something?

17:16.577 --> 17:19.872
- He said he'd cooperate for jjajangmyeon.
- Captain's coming. Clean it up.

17:19.955 --> 17:20.873
Sorry, sir.

17:24.460 --> 17:25.294
Hey.

17:26.754 --> 17:27.755
What's your deal?

17:28.881 --> 17:30.632
Where did you get that gun?

17:31.467 --> 17:32.301
The gun?

17:40.851 --> 17:41.852
I'll talk.

17:43.687 --> 17:45.481
But please bring that guy here.

17:50.652 --> 17:51.945
So we meet again.

17:53.072 --> 17:54.740
Why did you want to see me?

17:55.365 --> 17:58.243
I was totally out of my mind back then,
so I wasn't aware.

17:59.578 --> 18:03.499
But when you grabbed my face
and slammed me into the wall,

18:03.582 --> 18:04.583
I thought…

18:06.877 --> 18:08.170
"This guy is legit."

18:09.755 --> 18:12.674
"He's nothing like these lowlifes
in the gosiwon."

18:18.305 --> 18:19.139
Huh?

18:19.223 --> 18:21.350
What the hell is he talking about?

18:23.227 --> 18:25.813
If you have questions, just ask.
I'll tell you everything.

18:30.150 --> 18:31.527
Hey, raise the volume.

18:36.448 --> 18:37.533
Where's the gun from?

18:38.117 --> 18:39.243
It came by courier.

18:40.619 --> 18:41.620
Who sent it?

18:43.580 --> 18:44.581
I don't know.

18:44.665 --> 18:47.042
That bastard is talking shit again.

18:48.001 --> 18:51.046
Why would a stranger send you
a package by courier

18:51.130 --> 18:53.423
with a gun in it, of all things?

18:54.299 --> 18:56.093
Well, I don't really know why.

18:59.471 --> 19:01.181
Maybe because I wanted it badly.

19:01.807 --> 19:03.100
Shouldn't he be on meds?

19:05.018 --> 19:07.229
Well, I'm not sure.

19:08.689 --> 19:09.690
Mr. Yu.

19:12.651 --> 19:14.278
This isn't the time for jokes.

19:14.862 --> 19:16.155
You know, Officer,

19:17.739 --> 19:19.700
I speak only the truth.

19:28.000 --> 19:29.751
Have you handled guns before?

19:31.753 --> 19:33.422
Far, near, middle.

19:34.506 --> 19:35.465
In the military.

19:41.138 --> 19:44.016
Were the guns you hid under your bed
also delivered by courier?

19:47.144 --> 19:48.520
That's the funny thing.

19:49.563 --> 19:53.400
I made it clear
that I just needed one decent gun,

19:54.026 --> 19:56.445
so I'm not sure
why they sent me so many scary guns.

19:59.698 --> 20:01.533
Thinking about it pisses me off again.

20:06.663 --> 20:07.664
Mr. Yu.

20:09.333 --> 20:11.627
Do you know how many people died
because of you?

20:13.128 --> 20:15.631
If you have any remorse for what you did,

20:16.381 --> 20:18.884
please answer my questions honestly.

20:20.135 --> 20:20.969
"Remorse"?

20:24.223 --> 20:27.059
Do you think those bastards
felt any for what they did to me?

20:28.769 --> 20:31.897
Those bastards had no respect
for laws, rules, and common sense.

20:32.773 --> 20:33.774
Fuck them.

20:35.067 --> 20:36.151
No matter the reason,

20:36.902 --> 20:38.737
you can't justify shooting someone.

20:38.820 --> 20:41.031
You shouldn't be saying that!

20:43.158 --> 20:45.953
Just as the police catch criminals
and lock them up,

20:46.036 --> 20:47.913
all I did was get rid of scumbags.

20:47.996 --> 20:50.374
Thanks to me,
many people won't have to suffer.

20:50.457 --> 20:54.628
By taking out just 20 gosiwon scumbags,
I've made countless people safer.

20:54.711 --> 20:56.964
So why would you say that to me?

21:02.219 --> 21:04.846
What I did is no different
from what you did.

21:05.514 --> 21:07.516
I did the same thing you did.

21:11.270 --> 21:12.646
Do you think they're the same?

21:14.273 --> 21:15.649
Why won't you admit it?

21:18.777 --> 21:21.238
If I prove that I'm truly righteous,

21:22.614 --> 21:23.824
will you admit it?

21:29.663 --> 21:31.665
There are more guns.

21:33.667 --> 21:34.793
What do you mean?

21:37.504 --> 21:39.256
There are more people with guns.

21:39.840 --> 21:41.091
How do you know?

21:46.930 --> 21:47.764
What's he doing?

21:50.767 --> 21:52.019
Because I saw it.

21:52.894 --> 21:54.479
Saw what?

21:59.192 --> 22:00.819
People who want guns.

22:01.695 --> 22:03.405
And who are these people?

22:07.242 --> 22:09.661
That's a question
for civil servants paid by taxes.

22:10.245 --> 22:13.373
That bastard is playing dumb
just to screw with us.

22:14.791 --> 22:16.501
Given his psych history,

22:16.585 --> 22:19.379
he's trying to play
the temporary insanity card.

22:19.463 --> 22:20.964
We should still look into it.

22:21.715 --> 22:24.301
- A bigger incident could happen.
- Look into what?

22:24.384 --> 22:26.053
Hey, how does that make any…

22:26.553 --> 22:28.221
A gun? Delivered by courier?

22:29.348 --> 22:32.726
You don't actually believe
what that bastard said, do you?

22:32.809 --> 22:36.521
If he actually received it by courier,
he would've paid for it.

22:37.022 --> 22:39.691
But he only has 530,000 won
in his account.

22:39.775 --> 22:41.651
Clean transaction record, no credit card.

22:41.735 --> 22:42.652
Think about it.

22:43.278 --> 22:48.116
Who would send such expensive firearms
to a guy like him for free?

22:48.200 --> 22:49.785
That's what we need to figure out.

22:50.285 --> 22:52.162
Who is behind this, and why?

22:53.497 --> 22:55.957
- Why did you kill them?
- What was your motive?

23:07.052 --> 23:08.261
Please say a few words!

23:11.181 --> 23:13.183
Captain Joo. I just have one question.

23:13.266 --> 23:15.310
- I'm busy right now.
- Later.

23:17.687 --> 23:20.190
These are guns, right?
There are more, aren't there?

23:21.858 --> 23:24.528
This is an ongoing investigation,
so I can't comment on it.

23:25.320 --> 23:27.030
Come on, don't be like that!

23:27.114 --> 23:29.658
There were more guns there.
I know what I saw.

23:29.741 --> 23:32.577
Smuggled? Homemade?
What exactly does it look like?

23:32.661 --> 23:33.662
Hey, let's go!

23:34.913 --> 23:36.540
I'll write an article based on this photo.

23:36.623 --> 23:38.542
You're a reporter, for God's sake.

23:38.625 --> 23:40.836
Write articles based on facts,
not fiction.

23:40.919 --> 23:42.504
Go ahead. We'll see what happens.

23:44.131 --> 23:47.634
You're not giving me the facts,
so I feel like I have to make stuff up.

23:50.011 --> 23:50.846
Captain!

23:55.767 --> 23:57.185
Oh dear.

23:58.812 --> 24:00.021
Goodness me.

24:00.897 --> 24:02.774
Today's rice is cooked to perfection.

24:04.568 --> 24:08.029
The forecast predicted rain yesterday,

24:08.738 --> 24:10.407
so I was really worried,

24:11.533 --> 24:13.869
but the sunshine was so beautiful.

24:15.036 --> 24:16.830
I wasn't cold at all.

24:20.375 --> 24:23.462
Enjoy your meal until I get back, son.

24:24.588 --> 24:26.882
I'll do my best again today.

24:36.266 --> 24:38.185
LISTEN TO MY DEAD SON'S MESSAGE!

24:43.315 --> 24:46.943
Well, word got out that someone died here,
so no one will rent it.

24:47.027 --> 24:50.155
- I'm so mad, I'm losing my mind!
- I see.

24:50.238 --> 24:53.033
What are you even looking for in there?
For God's sake.

24:53.116 --> 24:55.702
We just need to check something.

24:55.785 --> 24:59.456
So no one came by to visit
or drop off any packages, right?

24:59.539 --> 25:01.249
What packages?

25:01.333 --> 25:03.877
I never saw any of his family or friends.

25:09.007 --> 25:10.550
Thank you.

25:19.809 --> 25:20.727
Officer Lee.

25:24.564 --> 25:25.982
What are you looking at?

25:27.734 --> 25:29.110
The gosiwon over there.

25:31.154 --> 25:34.282
Do you think there are more guns
like the gosiwon shooter said?

25:34.866 --> 25:38.078
I hope it's nothing more
than the ravings of a lunatic.

25:40.372 --> 25:41.790
I hope so too.

25:42.832 --> 25:44.751
Guns have no place

25:46.503 --> 25:47.879
in our daily lives.

26:01.810 --> 26:04.604
Fucking hell, these all suck ass.

26:06.273 --> 26:10.694
Hey, not a single one of these
is worth selling.

26:11.361 --> 26:12.737
Would you buy any of these?

26:13.738 --> 26:14.573
Hey.

26:15.907 --> 26:17.492
Do these photos turn you on?

26:18.243 --> 26:20.579
Fuck. You gonna keep taking
shitty photos like this?

26:20.662 --> 26:22.622
- Hey, Yeong-dong's here.
- He's coming.

26:22.706 --> 26:25.417
Fuck-gyu's dying. He can't breathe! Hurry!

26:25.500 --> 26:27.460
- Come on, hurry!
- Run!

26:27.544 --> 26:29.337
- Hurry up!
- He's gonna die, man.

26:29.421 --> 26:31.965
- Hey! Run! Hurry up!
- Run! Hurry!

26:32.048 --> 26:33.883
- Hurry!
- Run!

26:33.967 --> 26:35.802
Run faster! Come on!

26:35.885 --> 26:36.803
What are you doing?

26:37.512 --> 26:38.597
Hey, I'm sorry.

26:40.140 --> 26:42.017
Putting on a pig show?

26:42.100 --> 26:44.185
Here, bread and cigarettes.

26:44.269 --> 26:45.103
Here.

26:49.774 --> 26:50.609
Get up.

26:54.321 --> 26:55.280
Hey, Yeong-dung.

26:57.657 --> 27:01.745
I told you to make ten accounts for me,
but you still haven't done it.

27:02.537 --> 27:05.498
Seong-jun, I'm sorry.
I'll go make them right away.

27:05.582 --> 27:07.083
I'll get it done quickly.

27:10.378 --> 27:12.297
I'll make it easy for you once I get this.

27:12.380 --> 27:13.715
Okay, I understand.

27:13.798 --> 27:15.759
I'll do my best to fire myself up!

27:18.845 --> 27:19.804
I'll do my best.

27:25.644 --> 27:26.728
Let's go.

27:26.811 --> 27:28.897
- For fuck's sake. Fucking loser.
- Oh man.

27:28.980 --> 27:31.650
Do your job right,
or we'll visit your mom's restaurant.

27:31.733 --> 27:33.068
You stink of your mom's food.

27:33.151 --> 27:34.986
- Fuck, it stinks.
- Cheer up, okay?

27:35.070 --> 27:37.489
- Freaking loser.
- Let's play games.

27:38.782 --> 27:39.991
Good luck, Fuck-gyu.

27:48.291 --> 27:49.542
I'm sorry, Gyu-jin.

27:50.960 --> 27:52.545
I'll run faster next time.

27:57.092 --> 27:58.510
Just wipe off the blood.

28:04.516 --> 28:05.350
Thanks.

28:09.354 --> 28:11.147
Those sons of bitches.

28:11.231 --> 28:12.315
Don't do anything,

28:13.817 --> 28:15.318
or they'll beat you up again.

28:18.822 --> 28:19.823
This is suffocating.

28:27.997 --> 28:29.749
This is fucking suffocating.

28:33.795 --> 28:34.879
That's him, right?

28:34.963 --> 28:37.382
I guess he's too ashamed to show his face.

28:37.465 --> 28:38.383
You're right.

28:38.466 --> 28:40.927
Why does someone like him
have to live here?

28:41.010 --> 28:42.053
What rotten luck.

28:42.137 --> 28:43.096
Exactly.

28:48.309 --> 28:50.019
Those fucking bitches.

28:54.941 --> 28:57.861
Hey, give me two cartons of Marlboro Red.

29:01.990 --> 29:04.325
Please lower your mask
and show me your ID.

29:06.911 --> 29:08.371
Damn it. Hey, lady.

29:10.165 --> 29:11.583
Do I look like a kid to you?

29:12.125 --> 29:14.502
No, it's not exactly that.

29:14.586 --> 29:17.172
Just give me
the fucking cigarettes already.

29:17.881 --> 29:19.299
Did I do something wrong?

29:19.382 --> 29:21.509
I just came to buy groceries.

29:21.593 --> 29:24.929
Why the fuck are you looking at me
like I'm a cockroach?

29:29.350 --> 29:31.478
I just want to kill them all for real.

29:34.481 --> 29:36.566
For fuck's sake!

29:40.361 --> 29:44.407
Why the fuck would you block the way
to someone's house?

29:44.908 --> 29:48.328
If you ordered these damn packages,
take them in right away!

29:48.411 --> 29:50.747
What the fuck is this bastard's name?

29:52.081 --> 29:52.916
Park Kyeong-ja.

29:52.999 --> 29:53.833
PARK KYEONG-JA

29:53.917 --> 29:55.710
Is this Ms. Park Kyeong-ja's residence?

29:55.794 --> 29:57.003
My mom will be home soon.

29:57.086 --> 29:58.630
- Come in.
- Thank you.

29:59.923 --> 30:02.050
Do you need help
with your mother's packages?

30:02.133 --> 30:04.427
No, it's fine. Just come in.

30:07.138 --> 30:08.223
What the fuck?

30:08.723 --> 30:09.641
It's a gun.

30:12.143 --> 30:13.812
They actually sent this?

30:20.235 --> 30:22.195
Those bastards are fucking crazy.

30:25.406 --> 30:28.660
I mean, they sent me a K1 and a K2.

31:06.990 --> 31:08.241
This is it. Let's go!

31:14.455 --> 31:15.915
Hey, come down from there.

31:16.624 --> 31:18.293
- Hey, it looks good.
- Great.

31:20.003 --> 31:21.004
Jeong-man!

31:22.005 --> 31:23.798
Jeong-man. Gu Jeong-man!

31:24.674 --> 31:25.717
Jeong-man!

31:25.800 --> 31:28.845
Please spare me, Jeong-man.

31:29.971 --> 31:31.556
Stop calling my name.

31:32.348 --> 31:35.143
It's nothing personal. Just business.

31:36.269 --> 31:38.771
Yes, I know you're good at your job.

31:40.440 --> 31:42.609
You're a smart guy, right?

31:43.109 --> 31:44.652
With your brains, man,

31:45.486 --> 31:47.906
you can do better
than being Gong Seok-ho's buster.

31:49.282 --> 31:52.076
Gong Seok-ho promised
to give you the business

31:52.869 --> 31:54.412
if you took me out, right?

31:55.288 --> 31:57.498
But he's going to give it to Yong-gu.

31:58.666 --> 31:59.959
He won't give it to you.

32:00.460 --> 32:02.545
He's never going to give it to you, man.

32:02.629 --> 32:03.630
Mr. Kim.

32:04.464 --> 32:05.965
That didn't sit right with me.

32:06.466 --> 32:08.217
Hurry up and bury him. Quickly!

32:08.301 --> 32:09.302
- Okay!
- Hurry up.

32:10.261 --> 32:12.055
We gotta go before sunrise. Hurry!

32:12.138 --> 32:13.973
We met ten years ago!

32:14.057 --> 32:16.267
Don't worry.
I'll hold a nice memorial for you.

32:16.351 --> 32:19.979
Let me live,
and I'll give you some valuable info.

32:20.063 --> 32:23.149
- Those who say that never have much.
- Jeong-man!

32:24.400 --> 32:28.488
I'll help you take over
this entire organization, Jeong-man!

32:29.948 --> 32:33.284
Jeong-man, you can get a gun!

32:33.952 --> 32:35.787
You can get a gun, you bastard.

32:37.246 --> 32:38.247
Jeong-man!

32:41.584 --> 32:42.877
Come on, Jeong-man.

32:42.961 --> 32:45.254
Just bury him before sunrise
and be done with it.

32:45.338 --> 32:48.758
We're all fucked if Mr. Gong finds out
Mr. Kim is still alive.

32:49.258 --> 32:50.677
Jeong-man, just trust me.

32:50.760 --> 32:52.553
I'll make sure you get everything.

32:53.221 --> 32:55.431
A gun? Seriously? Are you for real?

32:57.100 --> 32:58.643
Why waste time thinking about it?

32:58.726 --> 33:00.561
Come on, think about it. Okay?

33:00.645 --> 33:02.063
- Say we get a gun.
- You can.

33:02.146 --> 33:04.232
How do you take over with one gun?

33:04.315 --> 33:06.317
There are so many people above Mr. Gong.

33:06.401 --> 33:08.653
No, not just one gun. There's a hundred.

33:08.736 --> 33:11.364
More than a hundred guns.
No, actually, there are tons.

33:11.447 --> 33:13.908
You son of a bitch.
You think we're fucking idiots?

33:13.992 --> 33:14.826
Hey, one sec.

33:15.493 --> 33:16.494
Come on.

33:17.495 --> 33:19.580
- What was your name again?
- I almost answered.

33:19.664 --> 33:21.207
- Yes, sir.
- Where's the update?

33:21.290 --> 33:22.333
Damn it.

33:22.417 --> 33:25.294
I was about to call you.
We just finished cleaning up.

33:26.421 --> 33:27.422
- Sir.
- Yeah?

33:28.840 --> 33:31.300
About the business
you promised after this job…

33:31.384 --> 33:32.301
What promise?

33:32.802 --> 33:33.636
Oh, that?

33:34.137 --> 33:36.180
I'm busy. Talk later when you get back.

33:39.976 --> 33:42.020
Gong didn't answer, did he?

33:43.021 --> 33:44.897
He's not going to give it to you.

33:49.736 --> 33:50.570
Fucking hell.

33:53.406 --> 33:55.658
Jeong-man!

33:57.201 --> 33:58.619
He's beating him like a dog.

33:59.704 --> 34:01.164
What are you doing? Bury him.

34:01.247 --> 34:02.790
- Let's bury him.
- Okay.

34:02.874 --> 34:05.334
Hurry up, we gotta get to work.
It's freezing, damn it.

34:06.252 --> 34:07.503
- Hey, bury him.
- Okay.

34:21.893 --> 34:24.395
Shit. Damn you, motherfucker.

34:27.940 --> 34:28.983
What now?

34:29.067 --> 34:31.903
This is the supervising officer.
Where are you?

34:32.403 --> 34:36.866
Fuck off. You monitor me 24 hours a day.
Of course you know.

34:36.949 --> 34:40.620
Exactly. Why are you in a place
you don't usually visit?

34:40.703 --> 34:42.163
Why did you go up that mountain?

34:42.789 --> 34:47.376
I came out for some fresh air
because you people are suffocating me.

34:48.753 --> 34:49.587
Hey.

34:50.463 --> 34:51.881
Let me ask you something.

34:52.548 --> 34:57.053
Where are you monitoring me from, huh?

34:57.720 --> 34:59.847
Tell me. Where are you hiding?

34:59.931 --> 35:02.433
I cannot disclose that information.

35:02.517 --> 35:04.185
"Cannot disclose that information"?

35:04.685 --> 35:06.312
I'm done talking to you, jackass.

35:17.698 --> 35:19.575
WARNING
THIS IS A MILITARY OPERATION ZONE

35:19.659 --> 35:21.536
UNAUTHORIZED ENTRY
AND PHOTOGRAPHY ARE PROHIBITED

35:21.619 --> 35:24.038
Begin with the ready marksmen, fire!

35:46.227 --> 35:48.479
Looks like I've still got it.

35:48.563 --> 35:50.231
All prepare to fire!

35:51.107 --> 35:53.442
Begin with the marksmen
who are ready, fire!

36:11.627 --> 36:12.837
I admire you, Officer Lee.

36:18.634 --> 36:20.720
By the way,
the firearms report I requested…

36:20.803 --> 36:21.637
Here you go.

36:23.931 --> 36:25.224
- Do.
- Yes?

36:26.184 --> 36:28.895
Did you request
the customs clearance list? Here.

36:28.978 --> 36:32.148
Yes. Something's bothering me,
so I just wanted to check.

36:32.231 --> 36:36.527
It's good to see you working hard,
but let the detectives handle their work.

36:36.611 --> 36:38.196
We should stay in our own lane.

36:39.322 --> 36:41.032
I know. I'll do as you say.

36:41.824 --> 36:42.658
I trust you.

36:42.742 --> 36:43.951
- Thank you.
- Sure.

36:51.334 --> 36:56.214
CUSTOMS CLEARANCE LIST
FIREARMS

36:56.297 --> 36:59.091
Hey, how come you haven't been
answering your phone?

36:59.175 --> 37:00.343
Why are you so late?

37:00.843 --> 37:03.512
It took longer than expected
to wrap things up cleanly.

37:03.596 --> 37:06.265
You should've called me earlier, then.
You bastard.

37:06.349 --> 37:08.059
Here's the picture of Mr. Kim.

37:09.644 --> 37:13.314
Oh man, this is a really great shot!

37:14.106 --> 37:18.361
Who would've thought
you had another talent, Jeong-man?

37:19.362 --> 37:20.446
Here.

37:23.366 --> 37:24.408
Get a move on.

37:29.413 --> 37:30.623
Fucking hell.

37:35.086 --> 37:36.420
- Hey, Jeong-man.
- Yes?

37:36.504 --> 37:38.798
- This place is nice, isn't it?
- Yes, sir.

37:40.091 --> 37:41.300
So,

37:42.510 --> 37:43.970
do my boys and I

37:44.470 --> 37:47.181
get to run this place from now on?

37:47.265 --> 37:48.933
What the hell are you talking about?

37:49.850 --> 37:51.477
Yong-gu will manage this place.

37:52.478 --> 37:54.897
- I'm sorry?
- Are you kidding me?

37:54.981 --> 37:57.441
Come on, just trust me.
This information is legit.

37:57.525 --> 37:58.359
No way.

38:04.365 --> 38:05.741
Fuck.

38:09.328 --> 38:10.246
Why?

38:11.622 --> 38:14.667
Well, you promised me last time

38:14.750 --> 38:16.794
that you'd let us run
one of these businesses.

38:18.879 --> 38:20.006
Come on, Jeong-man.

38:20.506 --> 38:23.217
Look around.
Does this place really suit you guys?

38:27.513 --> 38:28.347
But

38:29.265 --> 38:31.934
my boys worked really hard for you.

38:32.518 --> 38:36.188
We killed and buried people
just as you ordered.

38:36.689 --> 38:38.607
- We cleaned up after--
- Damn it!

38:39.859 --> 38:41.777
Make it short. Get to the point.

38:44.905 --> 38:47.116
Give us a chance to live
like normal people.

38:47.199 --> 38:48.492
"People"?

38:49.994 --> 38:51.329
What have you been, then?

38:54.540 --> 38:56.834
Weren't we just your obedient mutts?

38:59.795 --> 39:00.629
What?

39:02.131 --> 39:03.132
"Mutts"?

39:14.018 --> 39:16.562
For fuck's sake.
Do you have to be so harsh?

39:16.645 --> 39:18.773
You're making me feel like shit now.

39:19.273 --> 39:22.735
Fine, you asshole.
You'll get your own when it's time.

39:22.818 --> 39:23.944
So just be patient.

39:25.154 --> 39:26.030
Okay?

39:29.617 --> 39:30.618
By the way,

39:31.869 --> 39:34.288
do you know any of my boys' names?

39:34.789 --> 39:37.500
Is there anyone except you
I should know about?

39:38.250 --> 39:40.795
Still, they're all working hard for you,

39:40.878 --> 39:43.756
so I'd appreciate it
if you at least called them by name.

39:43.839 --> 39:45.091
All right. Hey.

39:45.174 --> 39:50.262
Take this, grab some food with your boys,
and wash up at a public bath.

39:50.346 --> 39:52.098
You stink, you bastard.

39:52.681 --> 39:53.682
Thank you, sir.

39:56.143 --> 39:58.521
Hey! Toss this on your way out.

39:58.604 --> 40:00.940
I don’t need Mr. Kim's ghost haunting me.

40:01.023 --> 40:02.274
- You dumbass.
- It hurts!

40:02.358 --> 40:04.235
- I took it out.
- Come on, for fuck's sake.

40:04.819 --> 40:08.072
- That fucking hurts, you bastard.
- Hey, this bastard is…

40:08.697 --> 40:09.865
He's here!

40:09.949 --> 40:11.450
He's here!

40:11.534 --> 40:13.869
Jeong-man, is this place ours now?

40:15.371 --> 40:16.914
Jeong-man, what is this?

40:16.997 --> 40:17.915
You look upset.

40:19.500 --> 40:20.334
From now on,

40:21.836 --> 40:23.254
Yong-gu will manage this place.

40:23.337 --> 40:24.171
Fucking hell!

40:24.255 --> 40:26.257
Gong Seok-ho, that son of a bitch!

40:26.340 --> 40:28.092
- Why?
- U-tae.

40:29.677 --> 40:32.179
- Did you search the place?
- There is a storage room.

40:32.847 --> 40:33.973
But it's locked.

40:34.723 --> 40:37.059
Mr. Kim knew he was gonna fucking die.

40:37.143 --> 40:39.228
Maybe he fed us some bullshit
to fuck us over?

40:41.147 --> 40:42.273
- Hey, Chang-ju.
- Yes?

40:42.356 --> 40:45.818
Take the boys to that gosiwon on the news
and see if there's anything there.

40:46.652 --> 40:47.653
U-tae, come with me.

40:47.736 --> 40:49.697
- Oh man.
- Hey, let's go. Come on!

40:50.281 --> 40:51.115
Guys.

40:53.451 --> 40:55.619
Take this, go take a bath,

40:55.703 --> 40:57.079
and eat something good.

40:58.080 --> 41:00.249
Sorry it came to this
after all your hard work.

41:00.749 --> 41:02.168
Hey, Jeong-man. What's wrong?

41:02.251 --> 41:04.003
- Hey, it's okay.
- Jeong-man!

41:04.086 --> 41:04.920
- Hey!
- Let's go.

41:08.507 --> 41:11.177
Hey, what's up with you? What is it?

41:11.260 --> 41:13.846
Seriously, what's gotten into you?
Jeong-man!

41:15.055 --> 41:17.850
- You know where Mr. Kim's car is, right?
- Why?

41:19.018 --> 41:20.019
Let's check it out.

42:01.477 --> 42:04.939
Fuck-gyu, grab your mom's ID
and get over here quickly.

42:08.108 --> 42:10.110
- Enjoy.
- Can we get a rolled omelet?

42:10.194 --> 42:12.530
Of course. One rolled omelet, please!

42:13.614 --> 42:16.617
DAESEONG RESTAURANT

42:23.290 --> 42:24.208
Hey!

42:26.752 --> 42:29.129
What's on your mind, Gyu-jin?

42:29.213 --> 42:30.756
Go ahead. You can tell me.

42:32.299 --> 42:34.051
Could I have 50,000 won?

42:34.677 --> 42:35.678
50,000 won?

42:38.347 --> 42:41.475
Why do you suddenly need money?
Is something going on?

42:43.310 --> 42:44.728
No, nothing's going on.

42:45.312 --> 42:46.355
I just need money.

42:48.482 --> 42:49.858
Do you really need it now?

42:50.985 --> 42:52.444
Yes, I need it.

42:54.238 --> 42:55.114
I'm sorry.

42:55.614 --> 42:57.116
Goodness, sorry for what?

42:57.199 --> 42:59.285
I'm busy, so just take it from my wallet.

42:59.368 --> 43:02.079
RESIDENT REGISTRATION CARD

43:03.205 --> 43:04.915
Thanks for the food, ma'am!

43:04.999 --> 43:06.166
Have a great day!

43:17.970 --> 43:20.139
- I'm going now, Mom.
- Okay, see you later.

43:35.404 --> 43:37.448
Hey, here comes Fuck-gyu!

43:38.032 --> 43:40.326
Hey, Fuck-gyu!

43:50.586 --> 43:51.712
Did you bring it?

44:00.346 --> 44:01.430
What are you doing?

44:11.023 --> 44:12.858
Fuck-gyu, you son of a bitch.

44:13.817 --> 44:14.652
You wanna die?

44:14.735 --> 44:16.570
Well, actually…

44:26.580 --> 44:27.998
Am I a fucking joke to you?

44:28.082 --> 44:30.626
I couldn't just bring my mom's ID
so suddenly, so--

44:30.709 --> 44:32.336
Then steal her wallet, fucker.

44:41.136 --> 44:43.806
I'm really sorry…

44:46.600 --> 44:49.436
but you're using her ID
to borrow from a loan shark, right?

44:51.897 --> 44:54.441
But the thing is, my mom works so hard.

44:55.984 --> 44:58.320
Instead, I'll take racier photos.

45:01.782 --> 45:04.868
Why the hell do I care
how hard your mom works?

45:06.829 --> 45:07.663
Well…

45:07.746 --> 45:09.498
Do I need to care about that?

45:10.499 --> 45:11.333
No.

45:12.418 --> 45:13.460
Let's try this again.

45:14.461 --> 45:16.463
Can you bring her ID by tomorrow or not?

45:22.594 --> 45:23.721
Yes or no?

45:26.890 --> 45:29.685
Yes or no, you fucking asshole?

45:31.145 --> 45:32.229
I'm sorry.

45:32.312 --> 45:34.606
You fucking son of a bitch! Damn it.

45:35.107 --> 45:36.525
Hey, just beat him up.

45:39.778 --> 45:40.612
Fucking loser.

45:56.128 --> 45:57.796
Where are the car keys?

45:57.880 --> 45:59.631
He said to check the tires.

45:59.715 --> 46:00.549
Look for them.

46:03.719 --> 46:04.803
Hey, the car keys…

46:06.555 --> 46:07.598
Found them!

46:08.766 --> 46:09.683
Open it up.

46:12.227 --> 46:13.353
Get out of the way.

46:24.072 --> 46:25.908
What the hell? Holy shit.

46:38.879 --> 46:39.713
Jeong-man.

46:41.381 --> 46:43.842
This doesn't feel right.
Let's think it through.

46:45.803 --> 46:48.055
Hey, you can't be rash about this!

46:48.555 --> 46:50.641
What can you do with just one gun?

46:50.724 --> 46:53.769
If things go wrong,
both of us are fucked for sure!

46:53.852 --> 46:56.563
So you're just gonna beg for scraps
from that bastard Gong?

46:57.856 --> 46:58.857
U-tae.

46:59.608 --> 47:01.693
That bastard will never give us a chance.

47:02.194 --> 47:05.948
"Just wait. We're almost there."
It's all just fucking talk!

47:08.200 --> 47:09.868
You, me,

47:10.577 --> 47:11.578
and our boys.

47:12.412 --> 47:15.624
That bastard is giving us false hope
and messing with us.

47:16.708 --> 47:17.793
What should we do?

47:19.211 --> 47:21.213
- Fuck.
- Keep living this way?

47:31.306 --> 47:32.140
U-tae.

47:35.060 --> 47:35.894
I see this…

47:39.523 --> 47:40.899
as an opportunity.

48:00.627 --> 48:01.795
Where's the gun from?

48:02.880 --> 48:04.006
It came by courier.

48:04.506 --> 48:07.384
Why would a stranger send you
a package by courier

48:07.467 --> 48:09.386
with a gun in it, of all things?

48:14.266 --> 48:16.226
Ever gotten a parcel
from an unknown sender?

48:16.310 --> 48:17.728
No, I have no idea.

48:22.983 --> 48:24.860
When does the Gyeongin courier arrive?

48:24.943 --> 48:26.570
Between 2:00 p.m. and 4:00 p.m.

48:26.653 --> 48:28.405
Have you seen this person around?

48:28.488 --> 48:29.531
No.

48:29.615 --> 48:31.742
What day is the recycling picked up?

48:32.242 --> 48:33.702
Tuesdays and Thursdays.

48:41.793 --> 48:43.211
Check thoroughly.

48:46.089 --> 48:48.342
Are we sure he wasn't bullshitting us?

48:48.425 --> 48:49.927
He said it was here.

48:50.802 --> 48:51.637
Wait.

48:52.346 --> 48:54.264
This isn't it. This is annoying.

48:54.973 --> 48:56.099
This is the police.

48:57.142 --> 48:58.101
What's going on?

48:59.394 --> 49:00.520
Well…

49:01.271 --> 49:03.982
We're trying to sell these boxes
for some extra cash.

49:04.066 --> 49:06.401
- You got a problem with that?
- Do you?

49:06.485 --> 49:08.612
Didn't you see the police line back there?

49:09.655 --> 49:12.032
This is a crime scene.
You can't just come in here.

49:12.115 --> 49:13.200
I can't read English.

49:13.283 --> 49:15.369
- You dumbass.
- Thank you for your hard work.

49:43.605 --> 49:44.731
Yes, sir?

49:44.815 --> 49:47.025
Hey, you know what Yu Jeong-tae told us?

49:47.109 --> 49:49.319
I don't think we need to worry.
It was all a lie.

49:49.987 --> 49:50.821
Sorry?

49:50.904 --> 49:55.742
We checked all courier records.
There are no deliveries to his address.

49:56.243 --> 49:59.705
In fact, he hasn't received
a single package in the past three years.

49:59.788 --> 50:02.124
He keeps saying weird stuff

50:02.207 --> 50:05.961
about everyone having a trigger
or something.

50:06.044 --> 50:07.504
He'll be a pain to deal with.

50:08.005 --> 50:10.257
Anyway, we're checking
the camera from the scene

50:10.340 --> 50:11.883
and nearby dashcam footage.

50:11.967 --> 50:13.969
I'll call you if we find anything.

50:14.511 --> 50:15.512
Understood.

50:16.763 --> 50:17.597
By any chance…

50:19.099 --> 50:23.311
Well, if you ever need help,
feel free to call me anytime.

50:23.812 --> 50:25.772
Will do. Thanks. Have a good one.

51:02.392 --> 51:05.437
23S-2549.
Jeon Won-seong is in that car, right?

51:05.520 --> 51:06.521
Hey, get closer.

51:07.105 --> 51:07.939
Yeah, Do?

51:08.440 --> 51:10.358
Yu did receive a package. I saw the box.

51:11.318 --> 51:14.529
But I think a man named Jeon Won-seong
in our area got the same one.

51:14.613 --> 51:15.739
What? Jeon Won-seong?

51:16.239 --> 51:17.866
We're chasing that bastard now.

51:18.366 --> 51:20.952
We're almost on him. I'll call you back.

51:21.995 --> 51:22.829
Okay.

51:29.419 --> 51:31.379
Jeon Won-seong! Get out of the car!

51:31.463 --> 51:32.589
Get out!

51:40.013 --> 51:40.847
Hey, get out.

51:42.182 --> 51:43.016
Hurry up!

51:43.975 --> 51:45.519
What? Move out of the way.

51:46.103 --> 51:49.106
Excuse me! Why are you doing this?
What did we do wrong?

51:49.189 --> 51:52.400
Sir, did you give this person a ride?

51:54.361 --> 51:56.404
This guy? He got out a while back.

51:59.449 --> 52:00.283
Detective Seo!

52:01.326 --> 52:03.328
Jeon Won-seong's ankle monitor and phone.

54:06.243 --> 54:07.077
Who are you?

54:07.702 --> 54:08.536
That hurts.

54:10.288 --> 54:11.122
Wait!

54:11.957 --> 54:13.333
My name is Moon Baek.

54:13.833 --> 54:14.793
Moon Baek.

54:15.502 --> 54:16.711
What are you doing here?

54:16.795 --> 54:18.088
Well, I…

54:19.714 --> 54:21.716
I came to pick something up.

54:22.217 --> 54:23.051
A package.

58:21.206 --> 58:26.211
Subtitle translation by: Sung In Jang
